# ===== Unity (잔흔 / Scars) =====
# Unity 프로젝트는 "My project/" 하위에 있음. 자동 생성 폴더는 모두 제외.
/[Mm]y project/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Mm]y project/[Tt]emp/
/[Mm]y project/[Oo]bj/
/[Mm]y project/[Bb]uild/
/[Mm]y project/[Bb]uilds/
/[Mm]y project/[Ll]ogs/
/[Mm]y project/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]y project/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Mm]y project/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset Store 도구 / 기타 에디터 생성물
/[Mm]y project/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Mm]y project/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
/[Mm]y project/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

